'''''Hypecoum imberbe''''', the '''sicklefruit hypecoum''', is a species of annual herb in the family [[Papaveraceae]]. Flowers are visited by ''[[Lycaena phlaeas]]'' (small copper).<ref>{{Cite web|title=Hypecoum imberbe Sm. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/487119|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Hypecoum imberbe (Beardless Hypecoum) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/PAPV/Hypecoum_imberbe.php |access-date=2022-03-03 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

